     A          R PM201                     TEXT('LA DATA SUBMISSION - HOSP')
     A            M2PRCD         5          COLHDG('PROCEDURE CODE')
     A***                            This field is necessary to ident-
     A***                              ify the actual procedure or ser-
     A***                              vice performed
     A            M2PMOD         2          COLHDG('MODIFIER')
     A***                            This field is used to identify any
     A***                              applicable modifier that further
     A***                              describes the service performed
     A***                              used in conjunction with the
     A***                              procedure code
     A            M2DUOS         3          COLHDG('DAYS/UNITS OF SERV.')
     A***                            This field is used to report the
     A***                              number of times each procedure
     A***                              was performed, number of visits,
     A***                              etc.
     A            M2CHGA         9          COLHDG('CHARGE AMOUNT')
     A***                            The charges for each service
     A***                              performed
     A***                            *** ROUND TO NEAREST WHOLE $ AND
     A***                                FORMAT W/O DECIMAL POINT,
     A***                                COMMAS, OR DOLLAR SIGNS ***
     A            M2TOS          2          COLHDG('TYPE OF SERVICE')
     A***                            Indicate which type of service
     A***                              is being performed for each
     A***                              code reported.  Use the codes
     A***                              below to indicate the type of
     A***                              service:
     A***                            1.Anesthesia: indicated by CPT4
     A***                              codes (00000-69999) and (92982-
     A***                              93562) or ASA codes (00100-
     A***                              01999).  If Anesthesia services
     A***                              are reported with a CPT4 code,
     A***                              they must be identified as
     A***                              Anesthesia.
     A***                            2.Surgery: indicated by CPT4
     A***                              codes (10000-69999)
     A***                            3.Dental: indicated by HCPCS codes
     A***                              beginning with "D" or ADA CDT-2
     A***                              codes
     A***                            0.Other services (CPT4 codes
     A***                              70000-99999, HCPCS codes other
     A***                              than "D"codes, OT & PT codes)
     A            M2PZIP         5          COLHDG('PROVIDER ZIP CODE')
     A***                            Povider's zip code
     A            M2DOS          8          COLHDG('DATE OF SERVICE')
     A***                            Date which service was performed
     A***                              (MMDDYYYY)
     A            M2PRNM        35          COLHDG('PROVIDER NAME')
     A***                            Provider's name to enable identi-
     A***                              fication of Provider
     A            M2DCON         7          COLHDG('DATA CONTRIBUTOR')
     A***                            Insurer/Self insurer identi-
     A***                              fication number
